The project contains three main files that work together to implement the Password Strength Checker
The **index.html** file defines the structure of the web page, including the password input field, 
strength indicator, and layout of the interface. The **style.css** file is responsible for the visual
design of the application, providing colors, layout styling, and responsive formatting to make the 
interface attractive and user-friendly. The **script.js** file contains the core logic of the 
application, using JavaScript to analyze the entered password in real time based on factors 
such as length, uppercase letters, numbers, and special characters, and dynamically display 
the password strength as Weak, Medium, or Strong.

